WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:05.760
Wait until Your Majesty hands over Xie Xuan, then he'll come by then no one can fault him.

00:05.840 --> 00:07.240
Enough.

00:10.240 --> 00:13.680
Order Zhu Yuanzhi to rescue the emperor.

00:13.880 --> 00:15.280
Yes.

00:22.000 --> 00:44.000
Not long after, the aristocratic alliance pointed their blades at the imperial city. Knowing well that no one would come to your rescue, you could only command your Great General to fight desperately to the end.

00:44.200 --> 00:51.000
Only at this juncture did Zhu Yuanzhi dispatch troops to defend the throne and quell the chaos, swiftly regaining control of the fractured situation and uniting with the prominent clans to elevate the Second Prince, Sikong Xu, as the new Emperor.

00:51.320 --> 00:56.160
The 21st year of Longwu Sikong Xu ascended the throne changed era name to Changning.

00:56.320 --> 01:00.400
Appointed Zhu Yuanzhi as Grand General Commander of all military affairs.

01:00.520 --> 01:04.640
May enter court without bowing, addressed without name may enter court with sword and shoes.

01:04.760 --> 01:09.800
Granted the nine bestowments and yellow battle-axe opened a government office equal to the Three Excellencies.

01:11.000 --> 01:20.000
Upon awakening, Zhu Yuanzhi sighed in gratitude: 'You fellows have certainly put me through immense hardship.'.

01:30.000 --> 01:40.000
On the journey back to the capital, your military command was stripped away and you were placed under house arrest in a detached estate, forbidden to take a single step outside.

